        "line": 476,
        "text": "theorem commonGraph_map (hQ : 0 < Q) (h : ℝ) (i : ℕ) (hr : 0 < p.2 0) : (commonGraph Q h i).map p = ((Q ^ (-(1/2)) * p.2 0, ((Q ^ (-CoordinateAlgebra.D h) * p.2 2, (1 - p.1) / Q), (SlotGeometry.cover ^ i) ((p.2 0) ^ ChartScales.radialExponent h • radialDirection + p.1 • timeDirection))), p.2 1)"
